#: package.description
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Main classic multivariate data analyses</strong>:</p> <ul> "
"<li>Principal Component Analysis (PCA)</li> <li>Correspondence Analysis "
"(CA)</li> <li>Multiple Correspondence Analysis (MCA)</li> </ul> <p>The "
"module is available in the <strong>Analyses</strong> tab.</p> <p>Project "
"source (and changelog) is available at <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti\" target=\"_blank\">Github</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>主要的多變量資料分析</strong>：</p> <ul> <li>主成分分析</li> <li>對應分析</li> "
"<li>多重對應分析</li> </ul> <p>此模組可於<strong>Analyses</strong>頁籤中使用。</p> "
"<p>專案原始碼（及變更紀錄）可於 <a href=\"https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Github</a> 取得。</p>"

#: R/corresp.b.R
msgid ""
"<p>This module computes <strong>Correspondence Analysis (CA)</strong> for "
"two categorical variables. Computations are based on <a href = "
"\"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" "
"target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR</a> package by F. Husson, J. Josse, S. Le, J. "
"Mazet.</p>\n"
"<p>The data can be</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>an <strong>Observation table</strong> (raw data), possibly weighted "
"using <em>jamovi</em> built-in weight system or using the \"Counts\" "
"variable</li>\n"
"<li>or a <strong>Contingency table</strong></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p><strong>Supplementary row or column</strong> numbers may be entered as "
"integer lists : 1,3,6</p>\n"
"<p>Four normalizations (scaling of row and column scores before plotting) "
"are available :</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><strong>Principal:</strong> Row and column scores are scaled by "
"eigenvalues.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Symmetric:</strong> Row and column scores are scaled by the "
"square root of eigenvalues. </li>\n"
"<li><strong>Row Principal:</strong> Only row scores are scaled by "
"eigenvalues.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Column Principal:</strong> Only column scores are scaled by "
"eigenvalues.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Standard:</strong> The raw coordinates without "
"normalization.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>A sample file is included at Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Smoking</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>此模組計算兩個類別變數的<strong>對應分析（Correspondence Analysis, CA）</strong>。計算方法係基於 F. "
"Husson、J. Josse、S. Le、J. Mazet 所開發的 <a href = "
"\"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" "
"target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR</a> 套件。</p> \n"
"<p>資料可為：</p> \n"
"<ul> \n"
"<li><strong>觀測表</strong>（原始資料），可選擇使用 <em>jamovi</em> "
"內建加權系統或「計數（Counts）」變數進行加權</li> \n"
"<li>或<strong>列聯表</strong></li> \n"
"</ul> \n"
"<p><strong>補充列或補充行</strong>編號可輸入整數列表，例如：1,3,6</p> \n"
"<p>提供四種正規化方法（繪圖前對列與行分數進行尺度調整）：</p> \n"
"<ul> \n"
"<li><strong>Principal：</strong>列與行分數皆以特徵值進行尺度調整。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>Symmetric：</strong>列與行分數皆以特徵值之平方根進行尺度調整。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>Row Principal：</strong>僅列分數以特徵值進行尺度調整。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>Column Principal：</strong>僅行分數以特徵值進行尺度調整。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>Standard：</strong>原始座標，不進行正規化。</li> \n"
"</ul> \n"
"<p>範例檔案可於「開啟 > 資料庫 > vijMulti > Smoking」中找到。</p>"

#: R/multcorresp.b.R
msgid ""
"<p>This module computes <strong>Multiple Correspondence Analysis "
"(MCA)</strong> for several categorical variables. Computations are based on "
"<a href = \"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" "
"target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR</a> package by F. Husson, J. Josse, S. Le, J. "
"Mazet.</p>\n"
"<p>Both classic methods are available:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><strong>Indicator matrix:</strong> CA of the indicator matrix</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Burt matrix:</strong> CA of the Burt matrix. The eigenvalues are "
"the squares of those of the indicator matrix method. </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Both methods give the same <em>standard</em> coordinates and "
"discriminations (but different <em>principal</em> coordinates).</p>\n"
"<p>When selected, <strong>Benzécri and Greenacre corrections</strong> are "
"applied to eigenvalues only (<strong>Summary</strong> table). Principal "
"coordinates (and inertia) of categories and observations are computed from "
"the original eigenvalues of the Burt matrix.</p>\n"
"<p>The <strong>Normalization</strong> options specify how the coordinates "
"are scaled (by eigenvalues):</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><strong>Principal:</strong> Both category and observation coordinates "
"are scaled.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Category principal:</strong> Only category coordinates are "
"scaled.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Observation principal:</strong> Only observation coordinates are "
"scaled.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Both category and observation coordinates are "
"standard.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>A sample file is included at Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Cars</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>本模組計算多個類別變項的 <strong>多重對應分析 (Multiple Correspondence Analysis, "
"MCA)</strong>。計算基於 <a href=\"https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=FactoMineR\" "
"target=\"_blank\">FactoMineR</a> 套件，由 F. Husson、J. Josse、S. Le 與 J. Mazet "
"開發。</p> \n"
"<p>提供兩種經典方法：</p> \n"
"<ul> \n"
"<li><strong>指示矩陣 (Indicator matrix)：</strong> 對指示矩陣進行對應分析</li> \n"
"<li><strong>Burt 矩陣 (Burt matrix)：</strong> 對 Burt "
"矩陣進行對應分析。其特徵值為指示矩陣方法特徵值的平方。</li> \n"
"</ul> \n"
"<p>兩種方法得到相同的 <em>標準坐標 (standard coordinates)</em> 及判別結果，但 <em>主坐標 (principal "
"coordinates)</em> 不同。</p> \n"
"<p>若選擇，<strong>Benzécri 與 Greenacre 修正</strong>僅應用於特徵值（在 <strong>摘要</strong> "
"表中）。類別與觀測值的主坐標（及慣性）仍基於 Burt 矩陣的原始特徵值計算。</p> \n"
"<p><strong>標準化</strong>選項指定坐標的縮放方式（依特徵值）：</p> \n"
"<ul> \n"
"<li><strong>主標準化 (Principal)：</strong> 類別與觀測值坐標皆縮放。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>類別主標準化 (Category principal)：</strong> 僅類別坐標縮放。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>觀測值主標準化 (Observation principal)：</strong> 僅觀測值坐標縮放。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>標準化 (Standard)：</strong> 類別與觀測值坐標皆為標準坐標。</li> \n"
"</ul> \n"
"<p>範例檔案可於 Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Cars 取得。</p>"

#: R/principal.b.R
msgid ""
"<p>This module computes <strong>Principal Component Analysis (PCA)</strong> "
"for several continuous variables. Computations are based on "
"<tt>stats::prcomp</tt> function.</p>\n"
"<p>Although rotated components are not principal components, they are widely "
"used. Only orthogonal rotations are available (from GPArotation "
"package).</p>\n"
"<p>Loadings (variable coordinates) and scores (observation coordinates) are "
"principal (scaled by the square root of eigenvalues).</p>\n"
"<p>Biplot follows \"Biplots in Practice\" (Michael Greenacre, 2010):</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><strong>Form biplot:</strong> Scores are principal (scaled by "
"eigenvalues) while loadings are standard.</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Covariance biplot:</strong> Loadings are principal while scores "
"are standard. </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced options</strong>:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><strong>Standardize loadings:</strong> loadings are normalized with sums "
"of squared equal to 1 (instead of eigenvalues)</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Standardize scores:</strong> scores are normalized with "
"variances equal to 1 (instead of eigenvalues)</li>\n"
"<li><strong>Rotate eigenvectors:</strong> the rotation (varimax, etc) is "
"applied to eigenvectors (standard loadings) instead of principal loadings "
"(STATA way).</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>A sample file is included at Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Iris</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>本模組計算多個連續變項的 <strong>主成分分析 (Principal Component Analysis, "
"PCA)</strong>。計算基於 <tt>stats::prcomp</tt> 函數。</p> \n"
"<p>雖然旋轉後的成分不再是主成分，但仍廣泛使用。僅提供正交旋轉（使用 GPArotation 套件）。</p> \n"
"<p>載荷（變項坐標）與得分（觀測值坐標）皆為主坐標（依特徵值平方根縮放）。</p> \n"
"<p>雙圖（Biplot）遵循「Biplots in Practice」(Michael Greenacre, 2010)：\n"
"</p> \n"
"<ul> \n"
"<li><strong>Form biplot：</strong>得分為主坐標（依特徵值縮放），載荷為標準坐標。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>Covariance biplot：</strong>載荷為主坐標，得分為標準坐標。</li> \n"
"</ul> \n"
"<p><strong>進階選項：</strong></p> \n"
"<ul> <li><strong>標準化載荷 (Standardize loadings)：</strong>載荷經標準化，平方和等於 "
"1（而非依特徵值）。</li> \n"
"<li><strong>標準化得分 (Standardize scores)：</strong>得分經標準化，變異數等於 1（而非依特徵值）。</li> "
"\n"
"<li><strong>旋轉特徵向量 (Rotate eigenvectors)：</strong>旋轉（varimax "
"等）作用於特徵向量（標準載荷），而非主載荷（STATA 方法）。</li> \n"
"</ul> \n"
"<p>範例檔案可於 Open > Data Library > vijMulti > Iris 取得。</p>"

